            <div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item"><section class="h2-cta-banner"><div class="h2-cta-banner__inner container"><div class="h2-cta-banner__eyebrow">Your Future Starts Here</div><h2 class="h2-cta-banner__title">Ready to Take the Next Step?</h2><p class="h2-cta-banner__subtitle">Whether you're starting college, advancing your career, or exploring new possibilities, NTCC is here to help you succeed.</p><div class="h2-cta-banner__buttons"><a class="h2-btn h2-btn--primary" href="https://myeagle.ntcc.edu/ICS/Admissions/">Apply Now <span class="h2-btn__arrow"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14" /><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" /></svg></span></a><a class="h2-btn h2-btn--ghost-red" href="/student-services/admissions-office">Request Information <span class="h2-btn__arrow"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14" /><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" /></svg></span></a><a class="h2-btn h2-btn--ghost-red" href="/visitors/campus-tour">Schedule a Visit<span class="h2-btn__arrow"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14" /><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" /></svg></span></a></div></div></section></div>
      
